  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6205.01 Fire Academy Facility Fees",
  "priorExpiration": "2002-03-04",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6205.01 Fire Academy Facility Fees. Fees for utilization of the fire academy facilities shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Use of the auditorium shall be charged at the rate of $175 per day or $125 per half-day;\n\n(b) Use of a double classroom shall be charged at the rate of $150 per day or $75 per half-day; and\n\n(c) Use of a single classroom shall be charged at the rate of $100 per day or $50 per half-day.\n\nSource. #7552, INTERIM, eff 9-5-01, EXPIRED: 3-4-02\n\nNew. #7747, eff 8-17-02; ss by #9496, eff 6-26-09; ss by #12477, eff 2-8-18 (formerly Saf-C 6204.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6200.html"
